From f618055e196df817bc63bb5f6e80cae256bfd6cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:04:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [games] Answer ListItem labels from a game's own details

A plugin can give a game its title, year, genres, overview, platform,
developer and publisher, but no info provider answers a ListItem label
from them, so a skin can show none of it. ListItem.Title and
ListItem.Year have been documented as working for games since v18, and
so have ListItem.Platform, ListItem.Developer and ListItem.Publisher,
though nothing parses those three.

Answer Title, Year, Genre and Plot from the game's tag, and parse and
answer Platform, Developer and Publisher.
---
 xbmc/GUIInfoManager.cpp               | 24 +++++++++--
 xbmc/guilib/guiinfo/GUIInfoLabels.h   |  3 ++
 xbmc/guilib/guiinfo/GamesGUIInfo.cpp  | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++
 xbmc/guilib/test/TestGamesGUIInfo.cpp | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

